Error: Jet.PayloadOnCaseGroup: Group `Fire` can't carry a payload
  --> Tests/UI/enum_group_payload.jet:2:9
    |
  2 |     Fire(Int) {
    |         ^^^^^
 Why: A variant group only names its subtree — data lives on the leaf variants
 Fix: Move the payload onto the leaf variants inside the `{ }`, or remove the `(...)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.PayloadOnCaseGroup
